    "summary": "The board approved the corrected June minutes, received the financial report, appointed Northside Surveying for a roof inspection, rejected the courtyard garden proposal, tabled the procurement policy, and left the officer training proposal unresolved.",
    "sections": [
      {
        "heading": "Opening and quorum",
        "content": "Eleanor Hughes opened the meeting and all five board members were present, establishing a quorum."
      },
      {
        "heading": "Previous minutes and finance",
        "content": "The corrected June minutes were approved unanimously. Priya Shah presented the financial report, which the board received without a motion."
      },
      {
        "heading": "Roof inspection",
        "content": "The board appointed Northside Surveying to complete the north building roof inspection for no more than £3,600."
      },
      {
        "heading": "Garden, procurement and training",
        "content": "The courtyard garden proposal failed, the procurement policy was tabled until August, and the officer training motion remained unresolved because no formal seconder was identified."
      },
      {
        "heading": "Close",
        "content": "The meeting closed at 7:00 PM."
      }
    ]
